<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-AWB confirms 400,000T wheat sale to Egypt.</title>
<headline>RTRS-AWB confirms 400,000T wheat sale to Egypt.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Australian Wheat Board (AWB) on Thursday confirmed that it had sold 400,000 tonnes of Australian Standard White wheat to Egypt.</p>
<p>AWB spokesman Alex Nichol would not reveal price.</p>
<p>The deal had not been done when the AWB denied on February 10 that it had sold 400,000 tonnes to Egypt, Nichol said.</p>
<p>&quot;You have to be careful that you don't rush through these things,&quot; he said.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
